recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the standfast is discharged: fourteen for fourteen, ceiling at zero, and the whole teaching tier under target. What remains of %163 is the 848 seed-dead links, which want the same per-document treatment, and the seed republish once you want it. The banked deep debride is still unspent and is now genuinely worth spending, since the sweep has stopped rewriting the same commit messages. The eight-season vision from your long message is still untouched and wants one expanded prompt that ranks it -- my read of its crux is Mycelium.
